<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00770">
	<title>Parking Safety button</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" outputclass="formatc" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="col1" colsep="0">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25E099_1.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<p>Press the Parking Safety button (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_087.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) to turn on Forward/Side/Reverse Parking Distance Warning. Press the button again to turn off the function.</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>When the gear is shift to R (Reverse), Parking Distance Warning will automatically turn on (Parking Safety button indicator on).</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
</concept>